<title>POLAND: TENNIS-POLAND LEADS GHANA 3-0 IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-POLAND LEADS GHANA 3-0 IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>POZNAN, Poland 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland took an unbeatable 3-0 lead over Ghana in their Davis Cup tennis Euro/African zone group two, first round tie on Saturday.</p>
<p>Doubles result:</p>
<p>Bartlomiej Dabrowskii/Berbard Kaczorowski (Poland) beat Franko Ofori/Nortey Dowuoma (Ghana) 6-1 6-2 7-6 (7-5)</p>
</text>
